<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('partials/head', { meta }) %></head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<section class="hero hero-upgraded academy-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">MABRIG Tech+ Academy</div>
    <h1>What do you want to do?</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Choose an action. Go straight to the MABRIG app built for it.</p>
    <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#start">Choose Your Path ↓</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="start">
 <div class="container">
  <div class="grid grid-3">
    <article class="card academy-card">
      <div class="project-badge">Digital Skills</div>
      <h2>Learn Digital Skills</h2>
      <p>Start practical digital and AI skills, build your portfolio and prepare for opportunities.</p>
      <div class="project-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://ddei.online/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Start Learning ↗</a></div>
    </article>

    <article class="card academy-card">
      <div class="project-badge">Software + AI</div>
      <h2>Build an App</h2>
      <p>Learn full-stack development while building real AI-powered web applications.</p>
      <div class="project-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.buildrx.online/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Start Building ↗</a></div>
    </article>

    <article class="card academy-card">
      <div class="project-badge">AI + Technology</div>
      <h2>Learn AI</h2>
      <p>Develop practical skills in AI, agentic systems, data and emerging technologies.</p>
      <div class="project-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.fintigen.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn AI ↗</a></div>
    </article>

    <article class="card academy-card">
      <div class="project-badge">Funding</div>
      <h2>Find Grants & Funding</h2>
      <p>Discover grants, scholarships, fellowships and research or business funding opportunities.</p>
      <div class="project-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.afrigrantpipeline.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find Funding ↗</a></div>
    </article>

    <article class="card academy-card">
      <div class="project-badge">Research</div>
      <h2>Do Better Research</h2>
      <p>Use AI-powered research tools for literature, analysis, writing and publication workflows.</p>
      <div class="project-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://scholar.mabrigkorie.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Start Research ↗</a></div>
    </article>

    <article class="card academy-card">
      <div class="project-badge">Security</div>
      <h2>Secure Your App</h2>
      <p>Audit code, detect risks and strengthen your software before release.</p>
      <div class="project-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/mabrig1/mabrig-devshield-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Audit My App ↗</a></div>
    </article>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="alt-bg academy-path">
 <div class="container">
   <div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Simple Path</div><h2>Learn → Build → Fund → Earn</h2><p>Start where you are. Use the next MABRIG tool when you are ready.</p></div>
 </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
<script src="/public/js/site.js"></script>
</body>
</html>